# Implementation Plan: Stock Clerk & Technical Evaluation Committee (TEC) Setup & RBAC

Implement individual role behaviors, dynamic sidebar navigations, custom dashboards, and permission boundaries for:
1. **Store Clerk / Storekeeper (`Stock Clerk`)**
2. **Technical Evaluation Committee (`Technical Evaluation Committee` / `TEC`)**

---

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Strict Role Boundary Separation**:
> - **Store Clerk (`Stock Clerk`)**: Assists Store Head in recording goods receipts, updating bin locations, executing bin transfers, and entering physical counts. Has **read-only** access to requisitions and vouchers (strictly barred from approving requisitions or finalizing/amending vouchers).
> - **Technical Evaluation Committee (`TEC`)**: Dedicated inspection panel responsible for evaluating pending goods receipts (Approve/Reject with remarks), evaluating returned materials (classifying condition as *Serviceable*, *Damaged*, or *Obsolete*), and confirming disposal justifications.

